msgid "What are Organizations?"
msgstr ""

#: ckanext/data_gov_gr/templates/organization/snippets/helper.html:14
msgid ""
"Data portal organizations are the entities that create, manage and publish "
"datasets. The portal includes both public administration bodies that are "
"required to publish open data under the institutional framework, and "
"organizations that choose to make data available on their own initiative, "
"strengthening the open data ecosystem."
msgstr ""

#: ckanext/data_gov_gr/templates/package/base_form_page.html:7
msgid "What are datasets?"
msgstr ""

#: ckanext/data_gov_gr/templates/package/base_form_page.html:10
msgid ""
"A CKAN Dataset is a collection of data resources (such as files), together "
"with a description and other information, at a fixed URL. Datasets are what "
"users see when searching for data."
msgstr ""

#: ckanext/data_gov_gr/templates/package/base_form_page.html:19
msgid "What are data services?"
msgstr ""

#: ckanext/data_gov_gr/templates/package/base_form_page.html:22
msgid ""
"A CKAN Data Service provides programmatic access to data through APIs, web "
"services, or other automated interfaces. Data services enable applications "
"and systems to access and process data automatically."
msgstr ""

#: ckanext/data_gov_gr/templates/package/base_form_page.html:27
msgid "Read the data service submission guide"
msgstr ""

#: ckanext/data_gov_gr/templates/package/base_form_page.html:33
msgid "What are decisions?"
msgstr ""

#: ckanext/data_gov_gr/templates/package/base_form_page.html:36
msgid ""
"A Decision contains decision documents and metadata organized so they can be "
"published, discovered, and accessed easily."
msgstr ""

#: ckanext/data_gov_gr/templates/package/base_form_page.html:40
msgid "What are packages?"
msgstr ""

#: ckanext/data_gov_gr/templates/package/base_form_page.html:43
msgid ""
"A CKAN Package contains data and metadata information organized in a "
"structured way for easy access and discovery."
msgstr ""

